OneDrive: a move whose retry fails reports the failure

Why: when a move hit a missing destination, MoveFile created the directory and retried, but
returned success if that retry failed, so prune could record a chunk as moved to or from the
fossils when it never moved.
Test: TestOneDriveMoveFailsWhenTheRetryFails
